{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 171,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        175.12208557128906,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Undesirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.485595703125,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "With respect to the potential harms of co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments, experts were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.952396392822266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.552734375,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "asked to report on AEs and, as a subset of these events, hepatic AEs. Co-administration of treatments",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985940933227539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4111938476562,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "may result in a decrease in overall AEs, but the evidence is very uncertain (RR: 0.72; 95% CI: 0.49",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.4353637695312,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "to 1.07; very low certainty in the evidence of effects); this corresponds to 223 fewer AEs per 1000",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.4244995117188,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "patients (95% CI: 405 fewer to 56 more). Among these AEs there may be an increase in hepatic AEs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.4014282226562,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "with co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments, but the evidence is very uncertain (RR: 1.19;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.4895629882812,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "95% CI: 0.23 to 6.16; very low certainty in the evidence of effects); this corresponds to 59 more hepatic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96579647064209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.2227325439453,
        385.2076416015625,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "adverse events per 1000 patients (95% CI: 240 fewer to 1000 more).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.03994750976562,
        325.3106384277344,
        225.89193725585938
      ],
      "text": "Evidence to recommendations: considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.0998077392578,
        527.5852661132812,
        247.5428009033203
      ],
      "text": "The GDG judged that the balance of effects probably favours co-administration of MDR-TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.29994201660156,
        527.6016235351562,
        260.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "HCV treatments for MDR/RR-TB patients co-infected with HCV, despite the very low certainty in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4998779296875,
        527.6171875,
        273.9429016113281
      ],
      "text": "the evidence for the critical outcomes, considering risk of bias in the available expert evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.69989013671875,
        527.2694091796875,
        287.1429138183594
      ],
      "text": "as well as imprecision in the calculated effect estimates. The GDG was of the view that there is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.89990234375,
        527.3970947265625,
        300.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "probably no important variability or uncertainty in how MDR/RR-TB patients co-infected with HCV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.09979248046875,
        527.4113159179688,
        313.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "would value the outcomes related to MDR-TB and HCV treatments, and judged that the option of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.2999267578125,
        527.3049926757812,
        326.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "co-administration of treatments would be acceptable and feasible. The GDG also noted that the option",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954405784606934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.4999084472656,
        527.4067993164062,
        339.94293212890625
      ],
      "text": "of co-administration of treatments would have presumed cost–effectiveness when both treatments",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.6999206542969,
        527.3946533203125,
        353.1429443359375
      ],
      "text": "were initiated together, without delay of HCV treatment. Given these considerations, the GDG issued",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.89990234375,
        527.5621337890625,
        366.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "the conditional recommendation suggesting co-administration of both MDR-TB and HCV treatments,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976825714111328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.09991455078125,
        488.1820373535156,
        379.5429382324219
      ],
      "text": "in preference to delaying HCV treatment until after treatment of MDR/RR-TB is completed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.9438171386719,
        225.79568481445312,
        411.60382080078125
      ],
      "text": "Costs and cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.81170654296875,
        527.3839721679688,
        433.2547302246094
      ],
      "text": "A cost–effectiveness analysis was not performed for this review, but the experts’ survey responses",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.01171875,
        527.3043823242188,
        446.4547424316406
      ],
      "text": "revealed varying perspectives on the cost implications of co-administering MDR-TB and HCV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.9356994628906,
        527.425048828125,
        459.65472412109375
      ],
      "text": "n n treatments. A notable 39% ( =7) of respondents indicated additional costs incurred, 11% ( =2)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.1357116699219,
        527.436767578125,
        472.854736328125
      ],
      "text": "n noted no cost implications and 28% ( =5) were uncertain about specific cost factors. However, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.6116943359375,
        524.427001953125,
        486.0547180175781
      ],
      "text": "GDG considered that co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments may have favourable cost–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.81170654296875,
        527.3783569335938,
        499.2547302246094
      ],
      "text": "effectiveness, in particular considering that this option may result in fewer losses to follow-up. Even",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.01171875,
        527.39794921875,
        512.4547119140625
      ],
      "text": "though MDR-TB treatment is typically free of charge to patients, whereas HCV treatment may lack",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.211669921875,
        527.3992309570312,
        525.6546630859375
      ],
      "text": "coverage, the overall cost remains constant whether HCV treatment is co-administered or provided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.4117431640625,
        527.5513305664062,
        538.854736328125
      ],
      "text": "with a delay. In settings where HCV treatment is not covered by national health insurance, considering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977877616882324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.6116943359375,
        442.01397705078125,
        552.0546875
      ],
      "text": "generic drugs is suggested as a way to alleviate the financial burden on patients.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.4288940429688,
        212.45652770996094,
        581.2809448242188
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        588.48876953125,
        527.5191040039062,
        602.9317626953125
      ],
      "text": "Despite acknowledging the data limitations and very low certainty of the evidence, the GDG believed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990646362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        601.6888427734375,
        527.5780029296875,
        616.1318359375
      ],
      "text": "that extrapolating to broader patient groups, including children, is warranted, especially regarding the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97647476196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.8887939453125,
        527.447509765625,
        629.331787109375
      ],
      "text": "potential benefits of co-administration of both treatments. However, the absence of data for specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.0889282226562,
        527.58837890625,
        642.5319213867188
      ],
      "text": "subgroups (e.g. pregnant women, PLHIV, younger children and patients with liver cirrhosis) necessitates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950789451599121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.2889404296875,
        527.4125366210938,
        655.73193359375
      ],
      "text": "caution in extrapolating the findings to all patients. The GDG discussed whether the specific findings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.48876953125,
        527.5375366210938,
        668.9317626953125
      ],
      "text": "could be applied to PLHIV, with reservations stemming from the absence of specific data on subgroups",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957769393920898,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.6888427734375,
        527.5974731445312,
        682.1318359375
      ],
      "text": "such as older individuals and people with comorbidities, and other factors that could not be obtained",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985039710998535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.8887939453125,
        527.6557006835938,
        695.331787109375
      ],
      "text": "through the expert evidence survey. The GDG underscored the lack of comprehensive data for these",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99839973449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.0889282226562,
        474.6871643066406,
        708.5319213867188
      ],
      "text": "subgroups and emphasized the necessity of cautiously approaching such extrapolations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.9060668945312,
        245.23455810546875,
        737.7581176757812
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        744.9660034179688,
        527.542236328125,
        759.4089965820312
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that clinicians should initiate co-administration of MDR-TB and HCV treatments in line",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971212387084961,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.166015625,
        527.2487182617188,
        772.6090087890625
      ],
      "text": "with knowledge and consideration about DDIs and patients’ comorbidities. The group highlighted that,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95455551147461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  157",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}